Eva's "Myths and Facts about Nethack" suggests that although you avoid
losing telepathy (since you are chaotic), you still incur an alignment
penalty of at least -15 for each peaceful
shopkeeper/priest/watchman/watch captain... I'm guessing you must have
incurred at least -135 for that.  If you were relatively early in the
game, your max alignment was still quite low, and the murders put you
into "You have transgressed" territory (alignment of -9 or below).
Praying with a negative alignment is bad.

